# Theme Canvas Animation — Skia canvas with six colour dots; tapping one grows a
# circular clip from it that reveals the new theme over the old one.
# What this test covers: every dot (2x3 grid centred on screen, 70pt apart) with
# the 1 s spring allowed to finish; re-tapping the selected dot (early return);
# interrupting a reveal mid-flight by another dot (radius reset + spring callback
# with isFinished=false); a rapid tap burst across dots; press-and-hold then
# release on a dot (scale-down on touch start, tap on release).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/theme-canvas-animation"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1500
# Each dot, letting the reveal complete. Grid: x 131/201/271, y 437/507.
press 201 437
wait 1300
press 271 437
wait 1300
press 201 507
wait 1300
press 131 507
wait 1300
press 271 507
wait 1300
# Back to the first theme (index 0).
press 131 437
wait 1300
# Same dot again: no-op.
press 131 437
wait 600
# Interrupt mid-reveal.
press 271 437
wait 250
press 131 507
wait 200
press 201 507
wait 1400
# Rapid burst across dots.
press 131 437
wait 80
press 201 437
wait 80
press 271 437
wait 80
press 131 507
wait 80
press 201 507
wait 80
press 271 507
wait 1500
press 201 437 --count 5 --interval-ms 90
wait 1500
# Hold then release on a dot.
longpress 271 507 700
wait 1300
longpress 131 437 400
wait 1300
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
